senses.gloss:
निः-√ सृ P. -सरति, (pr.p. Ā. -सरमाण, MBh.), to go out, come forth, depart, withdraw, Mn.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. -सारयति, to cause to go out, turn out, expel (abl. with or without बहिस्), MBh.; R. &c.;
to conclude, finish, BhP.

निः-√ श्वस् P. -श्वसिति, (pf. -शश्वस), to hiss (said of a serpent), R.;
to snort (said of an elephant), ib.;
to breathe, exhale, Suśr.; inhale, MārkP.;
to sigh, MBh.; Kāv. &c.

निः-ष्ठा (√ स्था; cf. Pāṇ. viii, 3, 65) P. निस्-तिष्ठति, to grow forth, rise, RV.;
 bring to an end, finish, make ready, prepare, ChUp. :
Caus. नि-ष्ठापयति (for निः-ष्थ्˚) to drive out into (loc.), Kauś.;
to prepare, make ready, KātyŚr.

निः-√ सृज् P. Ā. -सृज॑ति, ˚ते, to pour out, shed forth, RV.; VS.;
to let loose, set free, RV.; AV.;
to separate (as words), RPrāt.;
to remove, destroy (as sorrow), ŚBr.

निः-√ स्रु P. -स्र॑वति, to flow out or off, ŚBr. rise from (abl.), Cat.;
to disappear or be lost to or from (abl.), Āpast. :
Caus. -स्रावयति, to cause to flow out (as a pond), MBh.;
to cause to disappear from or be lost to or from (abl.), Āpast.
